{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"19":"Shares of Inheritance (Kitab Al-Fara'id)"},"section_detail":{"19":{"hadithnumber_first":2885,"hadithnumber_last":2927,"arabicnumber_first":2885,"arabicnumber_last":2927,"name_native":"Shares of Inheritance (Kitab Al-Fara'id)"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2893,"arabicnumber":2893,"text":"Narrated Al-Aswad b. Yazid:Mu'adh b. Jabal gave shares of inheritance to a sister and a daughter. He gave each of them half. He was at Yemen while the Prophet (ﷺ) was alive","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (6734)"}],"reference":{"book":19,"hadith":9}}]}